        Arabia. It is a cargo-fit and inland-distance decision, not a cosmetic naming difference.
        Shuwaikh is the planning default for general commercial and containerised cargo near Kuwait
        City, while Shuaiba is the planning default for industrial, petrochemical, bulk and project
        cargo in the southern corridor. Confirm the final discharge point with the carrier and
